{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1061843/block/singleImage/3256949/wm/01M6GP3H1PAW6S39Q54EDBR2GJ.jpg?updatedAt=1793708989\"/><figcaption>元朗區11月開局樓市持續暢旺，首兩天已錄得7宗二手買賣，較上月同期急升1.3倍。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>中原地產元朗區域營業經理王勤學表示， 11 月開局樓市持續暢旺，元朗區首兩天已錄得 7 宗二手買賣，較上月同期急升 1.3 倍。其中 Grand YOHO 新近錄得 9 座中層 C 室成交，單位實用面積約 519 方呎，兩房間隔。 王勤學指，上址原叫價 859 萬元放售，議價後以 830 萬元沽出，呎價約 15,992 元。據了解，原業主於 2016 年以 710.5 萬元一手買入單位，持貨約 10 年，現轉售帳面獲利 119.5 萬元，物業期內升值約 16.8% 。 即睇元朗 Grand YOHO 放盤 (House730)</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T08:45:49.422582+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":313,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T07:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T16:58:21.044707+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T08:38:33.218798+00:00","content_hash":"78a5e630bf4fce9667c65477b56a3ceed7744b252ff9f63ad97f386de34b97c5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-04T08:45:49.422582+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}